{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52547","headline":"风虎 · 陈元光","name":"风虎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾坤义气爲虎神，咆哮尚阚谁相亲。\n浮云满谷随相震，啸地生风鼓气新。\n日入山林膳百兽，时清效数宗麒麟。\n忍饥渡河知仁人，威彰挥爪雄武臣。\n戴王秉义无忘噬，作政行苛何诛夷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}